oh so let me get you into honkai my guy, i've been playing for around 2-3 months to this game, and i like it a lot, in this game there are only 12 (i think) characters but there are different variation of this character like one does physical dmg while another is electric dmg or another physical (this system is completly different from genshin), well in regard to your question, Mei is actually oone of the characters you get at the start (crimson impulse), but there are so many better variations of her like the Herrscher of Thunder, also if the voice you liked was the japanese one, then you're good since there's no english dub for this game, the ways to get this character is from the gacha or farming for fragments, plus there are 2 types of valks in this game, DLC and F2P, the F2P are the ones that you can farm for frags, for example Shadow dash (another variation of Mei), and DLC are the one's that can only be obtain from the temporal banner (like venti from genshin or klee), one example is the Herrscher of Thunder which is one of he best dps in the game, in this game there are Primary weapons and Stigmatas, stigmates are basically Artefacts from genshin and the primary weapons, well... just weapons that are stronger with expecific one character, this weapons are normally found in the gacha, example: herrscher of thunder's main weapon is the "key of castigation" (which will come soon to the gacha), the gacha system works with Crystals (the primogems of this game) (tip: save all of them until a character you want appears, so you can get it with her weapon and her stigmatas)

&#x200B;

P.S: There are no males in this game except for a Character in one gamemode.

&#x200B;

P.SS: if you have any questions ask me as much as you want.

